# =============================================================================
# .vercelignore — Vercel Deploy Exclusions
# =============================================================================
# IMPORTANT: Folders served via vercel.json rewrites/redirects MUST NOT be
# listed here. Adding a served folder will cause 404 in production.
#
# Currently served folders (DO NOT IGNORE):
#   - EI/                 (root: gswp.com.br)
#   - reserva-jp/         (subdomain: reservajp.gswp.com.br)
#   - jubiaba/            (route: /jubiaba)
#   - Ancestra/           (route: /ancestra)
#   - Fotos Zanuto/       (assets for reserva-jp)
# =============================================================================

# Build artifacts
node_modules/
electron/
build/
dist/
supabase/

# Dev tooling / framework
.aiox-core/
.antigravity/
.claude/
.codex/
.cursor/
.gemini/
.github/

# Original/backup folders (NOT served)
Fotos Zanuto-ORIGINAL/

# Archives
Livros.rar
*.rar
*.zip

# Heavy media — block by default, then re-allow served folders
*.pdf
!jubiaba/**/*.pdf
!EI/**/*.pdf
!Fotos Zanuto/**/*.pdf
!reserva-jp/**/*.pdf
!Ancestra/**/*.pdf

*.mp4
!Fotos Zanuto/videos/*.mp4
!jubiaba/**/*.mp4
!EI/**/*.mp4
!reserva-jp/**/*.mp4
!Ancestra/**/*.mp4

*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
